goes on in publishing,

00:50:36.690 --> 00:50:39.300
that makes any fucking sense for 2019,

00:50:39.300 --> 00:50:41.210
especially when the framework

00:50:41.210 --> 00:50:43.030
is the one that you and I have.

00:50:43.030 --> 00:50:44.310
- Yeah, there is some irony,

00:50:44.310 --> 00:50:45.590
and I've been in this business,

00:50:45.590 --> 00:50:47.670
which overturned this
whole established way

00:50:47.670 --> 00:50:52.109
of doing sequencing,
movies, and now I'm back.

00:50:52.109 --> 00:50:52.942
- Well you know what's
interesting about book form?

00:50:52.942 --> 00:50:53.775
People make fun of me a lot of times,

00:50:53.775 --> 00:50:54.990
like Gary, you shit on all this stuff.

00:50:54.990 --> 00:50:55.860
Why do you write books?

00:50:55.860 --> 00:50:58.010
I'm like, because people read them.

00:50:58.010 --> 00:51:00.560
I don't impose my way of
learning on the world,

00:51:00.560 --> 00:51:02.409
and I understand that
a lot of people learn

00:51:02.409 --> 00:51:06.150
in this format, by their desk at night

00:51:06.150 --> 00:51:08.640
four nights, bang through it, on vacation,

00:51:08.640 --> 00:51:10.710
like I have no passion.

00:51:10.710 --> 00:51:11.957
It's why I put out
content in every platform.

00:51:11.957 --> 00:51:12.810
- [Marc] Right, right.

00:51:12.810 --> 00:51:14.610
I don't care if you want
to listen to this podcast.

00:51:14.610 --> 00:51:16.920
I don't care if you're watching
live right now on LinkedIn.

00:51:16.920 --> 00:51:18.930
I don't care if one of the cool snippets,

00:51:18.930 --> 00:51:19.763
I want that selling.

00:51:19.763 --> 00:51:20.831
I don't sell.

00:51:20.831 --> 00:51:22.410
You know, if that becomes the gateway,

00:51:22.410 --> 00:51:24.600
like I don't get to judge how one learns.

00:51:24.600 --> 00:51:27.270
- Yeah, pretty cool.

00:51:27.270 --> 00:51:28.103
- [Gary] Thanks for being on.

00:51:28.103 --> 00:51:30.270
- My pleasure, it's been really awesome.

00:51:30.270 --> 00:51:31.710
- Thank you, pick up the book guys.

00:51:31.710 --> 00:51:34.010
I have a funny feeling
it's gonna bring value.

00:51:36.500 --> 00:51:37.333
- Thanks Gary.

